  "Software Details": "Yazılım Detayları",
  "The Dash Saas Bookings Module makes managing your appointments simple and hassle-free. Our easy-to-use interface lets you set up and adjust booking slots quickly, ensuring your calendar is always up-to-date. Whether you are a solo business owner or managing a team, our scheduling tool adapts to your needs. From one-time meetings to recurring appointments, you’ll stay organized and in control with ease.": "Dash Saas Rezervasyon Modülü, randevularınızı basit ve sorunsuz bir şekilde yönetmenizi sağlar. ",
  "/Month": "/Ay",
  "/Year": "/Yıl",
  "Buy Now": "Şimdi al",
  "View Live Demo": "Canlı Demoyu Görüntüle",
  "Simplify Your Schedule with Dash SaaS Booking Module": "Dash SaaS Rezervasyon Modülüyle Programınızı Basitleştirin",
  "Streamline your scheduling with Dash SaaS Booking. Integrated seamlessly into the Dash Saas platform, our intuitive module minimizes conflicts and enhances customer satisfaction. Simplify appointments effortlessly.": "Dash SaaS Rezervasyonu ile planlamanızı kolaylaştırın. ",
  "Great Customer Experience": "Mükemmel Müşteri Deneyimi",
  "Providing a great customer experience is simple with the Dash Saas Bookings Module. Clients can book appointments anytime through an easy online portal. Automatic confirmations and reminders help reduce no-shows, keeping everyone informed and prepared. The seamless integration with your website and social media allows clients to book services without leaving their favorite platforms, making the process smooth and convenient.": "Dash Saas Rezervasyon Modülü ile mükemmel bir müşteri deneyimi sunmak çok kolay. ",
  "Easy Integration and Customization": "Kolay Entegrasyon ve Özelleştirme",
  "Our Bookings Module works well with the tools you already use. Easily integrate with popular calendar apps like Google Calendar and Outlook to keep all your schedules in sync. Customize booking forms and workflows to fit your business needs. Whether you need to collect detailed information upfront or offer different service options, our module allows you to create a booking experience that matches your brand.": "Rezervasyon Modülümüz halihazırda kullandığınız araçlarla iyi çalışır. ",
  "Useful Analytics": "Yararlı Analitikler",
  "Get valuable insights into your booking trends and business performance with the Dash Saas Bookings Module/s analytics. Track important metrics like appointment numbers, peak booking times, and customer preferences. Use this data to make better decisions about staffing, marketing, and services. Our simple reports and dashboards give you a clear view of how your booking system is doing, helping you improve efficiency and profitability. Plus, you can manage bookings from both the backend and frontend, giving you complete control and flexibility over your scheduling process.": "Dash Saas Rezervasyon Modülünün/modüllerinin analitiğiyle rezervasyon eğilimleriniz ve iş performansınız hakkında değerli bilgiler edinin. ",
  "Online Payments": "Çevrimiçi Ödemeler",
  "With the Dash Saas Bookings Module, customers can pay for their appointments online quickly and securely. We support major payment gateways like Stripe and PayPal, making it easy for clients to complete transactions. This feature not only enhances convenience but also ensures that payments are processed efficiently, reducing the risk of missed payments and improving your cash flow. Offering online payment options helps streamline your business operations and provides a seamless experience for your customers.": "Dash Saas Rezervasyon Modülü ile müşteriler randevu ödemelerini online olarak hızlı ve güvenli bir şekilde gerçekleştirebilmektedir. ",
  "Why choose dedicated modules": "Neden özel modüller seçmelisiniz?",
  "for your business?": "işiniz için mi?",
  "With Dash, you can conveniently manage all your business functions from a single location": "Dash ile tüm iş fonksiyonlarınızı tek bir yerden rahatlıkla yönetebilirsiniz",
